4
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:19,010
Now pass it on to your mother

5
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:20,410
I can't stand it anymore

6
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:22,010
Shen Yi has inconvenience in his legs and feet

7
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:25,210
Naturally, her position is the most qualified to assume the position of heir apparent.

8
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,210
I accepted this ancestral bracelet

9
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:29,010
It's strange that she can feel happy

10
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:32,390
thank you mother

11
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:34,390
I like how

12
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:36,390
What did I tell you this morning?

13
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:39,030
My brother must be hungry

14
